# Updater signing key. Losing it means no existing install can ever be
# updated again; committing it means anyone can sign an update for our users.
*.key
*.key.pub
.murmur-updater.key*

# Rust build output. 24GB of it, and every byte is reproducible from source.
src-tauri/target/

# Whisper models are hundreds of megabytes and are downloaded on first run,
# never committed. See adapters/http_models.
*.bin

# The bundled model. 547MB, downloaded by the build, never committed.
src-tauri/resources/models/
